# Ingest pipeline

Sources load into **`ingest_items` / `ingest_item_files`** (stage 1). Stage 2 (`KeywordIngest`) adds Gemini keywords / photo roles / cover. Taxonomy and public `posts` come later.

All operational scripts are Katu jobs via `bin/cli.php`. **Interactive long jobs:** use `./bin/job` (TTY, Ctrl+C works). **Do not use `-T`** for those or Ctrl+C leaves orphans — then `./bin/job jobs:kill -f`.

```bash
cd ~/Sites/efemer

./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Database.Migrate -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.ResetImportedContent --args='{"yes":true}' -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.RefreshEfemerCz -f

./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.RefreshInstagram --args='{"account":"efemer_flowers","full":true}' -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.RefreshInstagram --args='{"account":"himmlhaus","full":true}' -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.RefreshInstagramAccounts --args='{"full":true}' -f

# stage 2 — Gemini keywords / roles / cover (default limit 20)
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.KeywordIngest -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.KeywordIngest --args='{"limit":1}' -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.KeywordIngest --args='{"id":123,"rekeyword":true}' -f

# eval golden covers/roles + corpus export for taxonomy
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.EvaluateKeywords -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.ExportCorpus -f

# clear LLM results only (keeps stage-1 ingest)
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.ResetKeywordEnrichment --args='{"yes":true}' -f
```


Uploads go to GCS `gs://efemer/{DEV|PROD}/…`. Reset/purge only touches the current env shard. Admin: `/admin/ingest` (pipeline + kind facets + keyword search).

Gemini key: Secret Manager `gemini-api-key` (see `gcloud-project.mdc`); local fallback `.secret/gemini.api`.

Eval sets (edit after human review): `app/Resources/Ingest/eval/covers.json`, `roles.json`. Exports land in `tmp/ingest/exports/` (gitignored, mounted).

| Job | Role |
|---|---|
| `Ingest.RefreshEfemerCz` | efemer.cz → ingest |
| `Ingest.RefreshInstagram` | one IG account → ingest |
| `Ingest.RefreshInstagramAccounts` | both IG accounts → ingest |
| `Ingest.ImportInstagramDump` | `data/instagram` dump → ingest |
| `Ingest.KeywordIngest` | Gemini keywords / vision → `keyworded` |
| `Ingest.EvaluateKeywords` | score cover/role eval sets |
| `Ingest.ExportCorpus` | CSV/JSON + keyword co-occurrence |
| `Ingest.ResetKeywordEnrichment` | clear LLM fields only (`yes:true`); status → `loaded` |
| `Ingest.ResetImportedContent` | wipe posts/ingest/pages + env GCS shard |
| `Database.Migrate` | schema migrations |
| `Pages.ImportEfemerCz` | legacy page-builder import |

Diary `postedAt`: body text date first, else index date. Upsert by `(source, sourceKey)`.
